<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-10T02:17:06.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-links-intro-e9e7f680-0ef2-4f6b-90ca-a7afe3ceeba3",
        "text": "Now, let's make our webpages *interactive*! The `<a>` tag, short for 'anchor', lets you create clickable links to other web pages or even other parts of the *same* page.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5b36ef0a005575a476b4337cc327bef7-intro-unit1-lesson2-links-intro-panel-1-c7c31636-ae03-459a-a5d1-90c61cfb11c4.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-links-intro-ab0df787-4aa8-4e49-a0be-5bcc5ddb9a21",
        "text": "The most important attribute for the `<a>` tag is `href`. It stands for 'hypertext reference' and tells the browser *where* the link should go when clicked, like an address!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/fea42d34a3293fda2034f7038d7d3489-intro-unit1-lesson2-links-intro-panel-2-405bdb48-82d1-4b85-a110-480e388191c7.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-links-intro-52231df5-0e3f-45cf-b82c-0299b8dbbde9",
        "text": "To link to an external website, you'll use the full web address: `<a href='https://www.example.com'>Visit Example Website</a>`. The text 'Visit Example Website' is what users will see and click.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/95559dee765c7033c31f2fab1e4c8241-intro-unit1-lesson2-links-intro-panel-3-2518031f-953b-4163-80b9-68c154bb79d5.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-links-intro-09a31c2f-8c07-46da-9840-770155898f30",
        "text": "You can also link to another page *within your own website*! If you have a file named `about.html`, you might write: `<a href='about.html'>Learn About Us</a>`. This keeps users exploring your site!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2523d43a74dda852d22ef5b46e891f59-intro-unit1-lesson2-links-intro-panel-4-55d1a00b-ece6-4aa4-8c48-0d399b2ab11d.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Explain how to create hyperlinks using the <a> tag and the href attribute to link to other pages or websites. Show examples of external and internal links."
  },
  "published": true,
